WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.871
Here is a previous n8n dispatch build.

00:00:02.891 --> 00:00:07.211
This is the real n8n editor, showing synthetic customer orders.

00:00:07.231 --> 00:00:16.296
I separate the parent responsibilities into Orders, Call, and Deliver, so the handoff to the child workflow and the outgoing request are easy to locate.

00:00:17.080 --> 00:00:20.784
Inside the child, the left branch takes the first orders.

00:00:20.804 --> 00:00:23.781
The right branch sorts and limits another selection.

00:00:23.801 --> 00:00:27.986
Left Project and Right Project produce identical product fields.

00:00:28.006 --> 00:00:33.616
Their business roles stay visible in the node names, even when the output JSON looks the same.

00:00:34.400 --> 00:00:37.058
The Select step returns the second input.

00:00:37.078 --> 00:00:40.085
The return data belongs to customers D and C.

00:00:40.105 --> 00:00:47.722
The important engineering detail is preserving the source input, output, run, and item across the child-to-parent boundary.

00:00:47.742 --> 00:00:52.088
Those coordinates decide which customer the parent's Deliver expression will resolve.

00:00:52.880 --> 00:00:55.278
Here is the saved failure from that build.

00:00:55.298 --> 00:01:00.268
Both workflows succeeded, and the HTTP requests returned success.

00:01:00.288 --> 00:01:07.267
The execution desk shows that the recorded pairing points at customer A, while the selected branch traces to customer D.

00:01:07.287 --> 00:01:09.920
The recipient-level check caught the wrong delivery.

00:01:10.680 --> 00:01:14.652
I repaired the provenance mapping and reran the same synthetic case.

00:01:14.672 --> 00:01:20.829
The repaired execution now agrees with its source records, and the recorded deliveries go to D and C.

00:01:20.849 --> 00:01:25.128
I keep the original and repaired exports together so the result is reproducible.

00:01:25.920 --> 00:01:34.785
For handoff, the operator can import complete saved parent and child records, inspect each returned item, and download the audit report.

00:01:34.805 --> 00:01:39.274
Source, editor exports, and before-and-after evidence are public.

00:01:39.294 --> 00:01:45.024
This walkthrough is AI narrated; the editor and saved execution views are real browser recordings.

